# Docker & infrastructure

Compose: `docker/docker-compose.yml` | Docs: `docs/09-docker-and-infrastructure.md`

## Services

| Service | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| postgres | Primary DB |
| redis | BullMQ + health |
| api | NestJS container |
| web | Astro static build served |
| prometheus, grafana, loki, otel-collector | Observability stack |

## Conventions

- Multi-stage Dockerfiles in `docker/Dockerfile.api` and `docker/Dockerfile.web`
- Env vars shared via root `.env` / `.env.example`
- API metrics at `/metrics` (outside `/api` prefix)
- Traces: OTLP HTTP to collector on `:4318`

## When changing infra

- Update `docs/09-docker-and-infrastructure.md` only if user requests doc changes
- Keep port mappings consistent with `docs/README.md` port table
- Don't break local dev: `docker compose up postgres redis` should still work for API-only dev

## Observability code

- API: Pino logger config, HTTP metrics interceptor, TypeORM pool metrics
- Web: `instrumentation.mjs` loaded via `NODE_OPTIONS` in dev/preview scripts
- Propagate trace context via `trace-headers.ts` on API calls
